  "title": "CRH Appoints Danilo Juvane as Head of Investor Relations",
  "summary": "NEW YORK – May 26, 2026 – CRH (NYSE: CRH), the leading provider of building materials, announced the appointment of Danilo Juvane as Head of Investor Relations, effective May 26, 2026. Juvane brings 25 years of capital markets experience to the role, having most recently served as Vice President of Corporate Development, Investor Relations & […]",
